### REST Client Test File (Aplikasi Manajemen Tugas)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check / Info API
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Mengambil Semua Tugas (Get All Tasks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filter Tugas Berdasarkan Recurrence / Jadwal ('daily', 'weekly', 'monthly', 'none')
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?recurrence=daily
Accept: application/json

### 4. Filter Tugas Berdasarkan Status ('completed', 'in-progress', 'pending')
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?status=in-progress
Accept: application/json

### 5. Filter Tugas Berdasarkan Priority ('high', 'medium', 'low')
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?priority=high
Accept: application/json

### 6. Pencarian Tugas Berdasarkan Kata Kunci (search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?search=Peliharaan
Accept: application/json

### 7. Mengambil Detail Tugas Berdasarkan ID (Get Task by ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. Menambahkan Tugas Berjadwal Baru (Create Task dengan Recurrence)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Memberi Makan Kucing Peliharaan",
  "description": "Memberikan whiskas basah dan air minum bersih setiap pagi",
  "status": "pending",
  "priority": "high",
  "recurrence": "daily",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-12"
}

### 9. Memperbarui Tugas & Mengubah Jadwal (Update Task by ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed",
  "priority": "medium",
  "recurrence": "weekly"
}

### 10. Menghapus Tugas (Delete Task by ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/3
Accept: application/json

### 11. Menguji Error Handling: Tugas Tidak Ditemukan (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/999
Accept: application/json

### 12. Menguji Validasi: Recurrence Tidak Valid (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tugas Jadwal Salah",
  "recurrence": "hourly"
}
